{"id":"n98a310f740","headline":"Iran Proposes Hormuz Plan, Trump Reportedly Refuses","summary":"Iran offered a plan to reopen the Strait of Hormuz, but reports indicated US President Donald Trump rejected it within hours. The waterway is central to the US-Iran conflict, now at a stalemate.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz carries a large share of global seaborne oil, so disruptions there directly affect crude supply and prices.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Iran","lat":26.6,"lon":56.3,"region":"me"},"entities":[{"name":"Brent crude","ticker":"BZ=F","kind":"company","sym":"BRENT","asset":{"id":"CM:BRENT","n":"Brent crude oil","c":"commodity","px":"BZ=F","la":57.5,"lo":1.5,"geo":"markets","site":"BRENT","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"aawsat.com","url":"https://english.aawsat.com/world/5322723-iran-proposes-hormuz-plan-trump-reportedly-refuses"},"sources":[{"name":"aawsat.com","url":"https://english.aawsat.com/world/5322723-iran-proposes-hormuz-plan-trump-reportedly-refuses"}],"published_at":"2026-09-26T04:46:32Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"d94eb63d90098394","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Reports that the US rejected Iran's Hormuz reopening plan leave the strait's oil shipping route blocked, sustaining supply concerns.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-26T04:46:32Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-26T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-2251248.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"michaelmep","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay